But I name all my wands that don't do anything on
Engrave testing, and all my rings that don't do
anything on donning, as "NVE" (for "no visible
effect", because even though I type fast, I'm lazy).

I find I've really sabotaged myself if I use _just_
that name, so instead they get named like NVE#01,
NVE#02, ... which works much better in little "edge"
situations where it's really important to know which
was the most recently attempted type.

